<title>FRANCE: ATHLETICS-WORLD CROSS CHALLENGE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-WORLD CROSS CHALLENGE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOURCOING, France 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results in the 12th Cross Auchon, sixth round of the 1996-97 International Amateur Athletic Federation World Cross Challenge series, on Saturday:</p>
<p>Men (9.7 km)</p>
<p> 1. Bernard Barmasai (Kenya)	  27 minutes 58 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Laban Chege (Kenya)			   28:14</p>
<p> 3. Hezron Mokamba (Kenya)			28:19</p>
<p> 4. Barnabas Barnao (Kenya)		     28:23</p>
<p> 5. Andrew Pearson (Britain)		    28:25</p>
<p> 6. Mathias Ntawulikura (Rwanda)		28:28</p>
<p> 7. Paul Chemase (Kenya)			  28:41</p>
<p> 8. James Kariuki (Kenya)			 28:42</p>
<p> 9. Robert Stefko (Slovakia)		    28:44</p>
<p> 10.Yann Millon (France)			  28:45</p>
<p>Women (5.4 km)</p>
<p> 1. Elena Fidatov (Romania)		     17:00</p>
<p> 2. Catherina McKiernan (Ireland)	     17:08</p>
<p> 3. Colleen de Reuck (South Africa)	   17:12</p>
<p> 4. Paula Radcliffe (Britain)		   17:20</p>
<p> 5. Laurence Duquenoy (France)		  17:38</p>
